OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA chilly     
OL,6,Fnight to follow, with high cloud and   
OL,7,Fperhaps a few clear spells developing  
OL,8,Fbefore dawn allowing temperatures to   
OL,9,Fdrop off with a widespread frost.      
OL,10,FRemaining dry but breezy.              
OL,12,CThursday:FRemaining dry on Thursday    
OL,13,Fwith a few brighter spells developing  
OL,14,Flater in the south. Turning breezy     
OL,15,Fwith strong winds developing towards   
OL,16,Fcoasts and over hills by evening.      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
