OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain     
OL,6,Fspreads eastwards on Friday,           
OL,7,Fpersistent at times and turning wintry 
OL,8,Fover hills. Rain clearing late         
OL,9,Fsaturday and generally clear and less  
OL,10,Fcold sunday. Frosty overnight.         
